  "description": "Tree species: Robina lime trees (Indigo Surveys/ plan reference: T13-B2 & T14-A2) Location: Wandsworth Common, adjacent to footpath, to the south east of 45 Lyford road, SW18 3LU. Description of works: Overhanging branches from 2no. Robina Lime trees along the south-east boundary to No. 45 Lyford road to be pruned back approximately 2m along boundary line. NB. The tree pruning works are proposed to enable the construction works for the approved replacement dwelling at 45 Lyford road to safely proceed, without risking damage to these trees.",
